WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:42.330
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:42.600 --> 01:48.020
[When I Meet The Moon]

3
01:48.090 --> 01:50.759
[Episode 25]

4
02:06.700 --> 02:07.500
How was it?

5
02:07.640 --> 02:09.520
Good thing I stepped in to help you just now,

6
02:09.520 --> 02:10.860
otherwise Dad would have kept

7
02:10.860 --> 02:12.860
scolding you for who knows how long.

8
02:13.960 --> 02:15.490
You should give me a reward.

9
02:15.630 --> 02:16.500
Not much.

10
02:16.650 --> 02:17.460
Just 200.

11
02:20.360 --> 02:21.800
Who knows if you were really helping me

12
02:21.800 --> 02:23.600
or just having fun at my expense?

13
02:24.240 --> 02:25.030
Yun Li.

14
02:25.500 --> 02:27.460
You're biting the hand that feeds you.

15
02:27.460 --> 02:28.000
If you're going to be like this,

16
02:28.000 --> 02:29.360
I won't help you next time.

17
02:29.360 --> 02:30.690
Are you threatening me?

18
02:31.400 --> 02:32.560
Fine, then I'll tell everyone

19
02:32.560 --> 02:33.890
about your secrets too.

20
02:34.150 --> 02:34.620
I...

21
02:38.410 --> 02:39.400
Go tell them.

22
02:39.500 --> 02:40.690
Go ahead and tell them.

23
02:40.690 --> 02:42.240
Dad will definitely say,

24
02:42.240 --> 02:43.300
"Look at your brother, only 18,

25
02:43.300 --> 02:43.930
and he already found

26
02:43.930 --> 02:45.300
such a great girlfriend.

27
02:45.300 --> 02:46.300
He's so charming.

28
02:46.430 --> 02:47.360
What about you?"

29
02:49.590 --> 02:50.400
Li,

30
02:50.840 --> 02:51.630
if you ask me,

31
02:51.900 --> 02:53.430
you should just go meet him.

32
02:53.560 --> 02:55.800
Don't be so opposed to blind dates.

33
02:56.690 --> 02:58.500
What if you meet a good match?

34
02:58.500 --> 02:59.300
I'm not going.

35
03:01.650 --> 03:03.250
Yun Ye, whose side are you on?

36
03:03.500 --> 03:05.090
I'm on your side, of course.

37
03:05.090 --> 03:07.090
But I... I just don't want

38
03:07.090 --> 03:07.900
you and Dad

39
03:08.550 --> 03:09.680
to keep fighting.

40
03:09.910 --> 03:11.770
It's not good for family harmony.

41
03:13.560 --> 03:15.190
Don't you agree?

42
03:21.520 --> 03:22.329
Li,

43
03:22.450 --> 03:24.630
your ex-boyfriend seems to be sick.

44
03:29.060 --> 03:30.780
Do you want to go see him?

45
03:32.930 --> 03:33.740
No.

46
03:34.030 --> 03:35.250
It has

47
03:35.250 --> 03:36.530
nothing to do with me.

48
03:47.030 --> 03:48.360
Is there anything else?

49
03:49.360 --> 03:50.820
If not, stop sitting here.

50
03:52.530 --> 03:53.340
I'm leaving.

51
03:55.240 --> 03:56.300
200. Don't forget.

52
04:22.190 --> 04:23.000
Lili.

53
04:29.360 --> 04:30.450
Why are you here?

54
04:35.330 --> 04:36.130
I...

55
04:36.560 --> 04:38.000
It's Yun Ye.

56
04:38.300 --> 04:39.659
He left a notebook

57
04:39.659 --> 04:40.930
in the lab.

58
04:41.320 --> 04:42.600
I... I was on my way,

59
04:42.600 --> 04:44.390
so I'm picking it up for him.

60
04:48.130 --> 04:49.260
I'll take you there.

61
04:50.480 --> 04:51.180
Okay.

62
04:52.860 --> 04:53.920
Let's go. This way.

63
05:10.180 --> 05:11.040
The second desk

64
05:11.040 --> 05:12.150
is Yun Ye's.

65
05:30.390 --> 05:31.930
Yun Li, what are you doing?

66
05:32.340 --> 05:33.920
You're being ridiculous.

67
05:36.890 --> 05:37.750
Did you find it?

68
05:38.240 --> 05:39.300
N-Not yet.

69
05:40.159 --> 05:40.890
What does it look like?

70
05:40.890 --> 05:41.850
I'll help you look.

71
05:41.850 --> 05:42.730
Never mind.

72
05:43.100 --> 05:44.300
Maybe Yun Ye doesn't even know

73
05:44.300 --> 05:45.690
where he put it.

74
05:47.360 --> 05:48.190
I'm sorry

75
05:48.220 --> 05:49.890
for making you bring me here.

76
05:51.450 --> 05:52.250
It's fine.

77
06:00.300 --> 06:01.860
Are you sick?

78
06:02.660 --> 06:04.130
Are you feeling unwell?

79
06:06.100 --> 06:06.890
Insomnia.

80
06:10.130 --> 06:12.130
What did you think was wrong with me?

81
06:13.740 --> 06:14.630
Nothing.

82
06:15.040 --> 06:17.100
It's just... it's been so long,

83
06:17.100 --> 06:18.960
and your insomnia is still so bad.

84
06:19.830 --> 06:21.430
It doesn't happen every day.

85
06:22.040 --> 06:23.040
It comes and goes.

86
06:23.250 --> 06:24.190
I dream a lot.

87
06:38.930 --> 06:39.659
If there's nothing else,

88
06:39.659 --> 06:40.920
I-I'll get going then.

89
06:41.130 --> 06:42.240
If you're not busy,

90
06:42.240 --> 06:44.770
would you like to come by my office for a while?

91
06:46.240 --> 06:46.840
Oh, right.

92
06:46.850 --> 06:48.710
I happen to have a thesis template

93
06:49.040 --> 06:49.830
that may be useful for Yun Ye.

94
06:49.830 --> 06:51.030
You can take it to him.

95
06:54.930 --> 06:56.060
I'll take you there.

96
07:16.250 --> 07:17.220
First, open

97
07:17.220 --> 07:18.190
that document from earlier.

98
07:18.190 --> 07:19.220
Okay. This one?

99
07:19.370 --> 07:20.190
Yes, this one.

100
07:20.190 --> 07:20.870
Let me see.

101
07:20.890 --> 07:22.090
Just use this new one.

102
07:22.500 --> 07:24.600
Everyone looks so busy.

103
07:27.300 --> 07:28.190
Our daily life

104
07:28.190 --> 07:29.190
is just like this.

105
07:29.500 --> 07:31.190
Dormitory and lab.

106
07:31.660 --> 07:32.500
See?

107
07:32.700 --> 07:34.360
That's Senior's girlfriend.

108
07:34.860 --> 07:36.460
She's the one I saw last time.

109
07:44.060 --> 07:44.930
S-Sorry.

110
07:46.810 --> 07:47.810
Here's my office.

111
07:57.100 --> 07:58.500
This is my office.

112
07:59.250 --> 08:00.560
If you need me in the future,

113
08:00.560 --> 08:01.740
you can come here.

114
08:15.190 --> 08:16.450
First, fold it in half.

115
08:17.240 --> 08:18.060
Then,

116
08:18.310 --> 08:20.420
fold this side to the center line.

117
08:21.100 --> 08:22.240
You even know how to do this?

118
08:22.240 --> 08:23.250
I'm a content creator.

119
08:23.250 --> 08:24.660
I have to learn a lot of skills.

120
08:24.660 --> 08:26.660
Tying knots, origami—

121
08:26.660 --> 08:28.190
I know a lot of these things.

122
08:31.240 --> 08:32.440
This side is the same.

123
08:36.360 --> 08:37.150
Like this.

124
08:38.250 --> 08:39.390
Then open it.

125
08:42.460 --> 08:43.250
Like this.

126
08:45.000 --> 08:46.100
Why does mine look

127
08:46.100 --> 08:47.250
different from yours?

128
08:47.250 --> 08:49.050
Yeah. Let me see.

129
08:50.510 --> 08:51.980
It should be...

130
08:52.560 --> 08:54.490
Why is it different? I must have...

131
08:58.820 --> 08:59.420
Like this?

132
09:03.340 --> 09:04.600
Which way should it go?

133
09:07.000 --> 09:07.800
Right, right.

134
09:08.750 --> 09:09.390
Then...

135
09:09.960 --> 09:11.420
D-Do the same on this side.

136
09:12.100 --> 09:13.250
Fold it over.

137
09:35.000 --> 09:35.790
Well?

138
09:37.290 --> 09:38.500
Have I improved a lot?

139
09:47.650 --> 09:49.780
I didn't expect you to still remember.

140
09:53.890 --> 09:56.670
You really have improved a lot.

141
10:03.440 --> 10:05.500
I've been folding them often lately.

142
10:08.290 --> 10:10.090
And whenever I think of the past,

143
10:11.550 --> 10:12.460
I unconsciously end up making

144
10:12.460 --> 10:13.660
more and more of them.

145
10:23.460 --> 10:24.460
Does it look good?

146
10:28.120 --> 10:29.740
Yeah, pretty good.

147
10:30.240 --> 10:31.030
It's for you.

148
10:39.250 --> 10:40.440
If you like it,

149
10:40.960 --> 10:42.090
you can take it back.

150
10:53.390 --> 10:54.180
Oh, right.

151
10:55.820 --> 10:56.620
Please...

152
10:57.240 --> 10:58.390
give this to Yun Ye.

153
11:14.150 --> 11:15.440
It's getting late.

154
11:15.630 --> 11:17.050
I'm heading back.

155
11:17.740 --> 11:18.740
I'll walk you out.

156
11:19.530 --> 11:20.580
Hurry! Let's go!

157
11:21.030 --> 11:21.650
Let's go!

158
11:57.700 --> 11:58.500
She's the girl

159
11:58.500 --> 12:00.160
on Senior's phone wallpaper.

160
12:00.740 --> 12:02.240
So she's the wallpaper girl.

161
12:02.240 --> 12:03.250
Is she the girl

162
12:03.250 --> 12:04.630
Senior has had a crush on for a long time?

163
12:04.630 --> 12:05.600
Who knows?

164
12:06.770 --> 12:08.200
Do you think Senior

165
12:08.200 --> 12:09.720
is pursuing her now?

166
12:09.910 --> 12:10.910
Looks like it.

167
12:14.010 --> 12:14.860
It's for you.

168
12:15.550 --> 12:16.500
Do you like it?

169
12:17.290 --> 12:18.530
Take it if you like it.

170
12:23.060 --> 12:24.240
He usually doesn't even let me touch

171
12:24.240 --> 12:25.480
that paper lantern,

172
12:25.510 --> 12:26.620
and now he actually gave it away.

173
12:26.620 --> 12:27.390
Seriously.

174
12:27.510 --> 12:28.960
It's one thing to give it away,

175
12:28.960 --> 12:29.890
but he even said,

176
12:30.530 --> 12:33.070
"I... make them often."

177
12:38.760 --> 12:39.400
Senior.

178
12:39.430 --> 12:40.120
Senior.

179
12:41.100 --> 12:42.720
Have you finished writing the report?

180
12:42.720 --> 12:43.720
Yes, Senior.

181
12:43.720 --> 12:44.390
I'll send it to you right away.

182
12:44.390 --> 12:44.960
Let's go.

183
12:51.890 --> 12:52.700
Senior.

184
12:52.910 --> 12:54.200
Your way of pursuing someone

185
12:54.200 --> 12:55.650
is too subtle.

186
12:56.150 --> 12:57.510
She might not even know

187
12:57.510 --> 12:59.250
you're pursuing her.

188
13:01.720 --> 13:02.920
Then what should I do?

189
13:03.360 --> 13:05.410
Tell her how you feel about her directly.

190
13:05.410 --> 13:07.340
Who could resist your confession?

191
13:07.960 --> 13:08.860
Confession?

192
13:11.510 --> 13:12.460
If I do that now,

193
13:12.890 --> 13:14.550
she might delete me on WeChat.

194
13:15.940 --> 13:17.940
Someone would actually delete you?

195
13:19.500 --> 13:20.700
She deleted me twice.

196
13:26.220 --> 13:27.150
Come on, Senior.

197
13:27.550 --> 13:29.280
And you're still pursuing her?

198
13:29.460 --> 13:30.250
Yes.

199
13:31.360 --> 13:32.360
Yeah, Senior.

200
13:33.150 --> 13:34.820
So many people are pursuing you.

201
13:34.820 --> 13:36.360
There's no need to pursue someone

202
13:36.360 --> 13:37.700
who deleted you twice.

203
13:37.700 --> 13:39.250
She's so headstrong.

204
13:41.030 --> 13:41.840
Senior.

205
13:42.360 --> 13:45.250
Are you a bit of a hopeless romantic?

206
13:50.890 --> 13:52.090
A hopeless romantic?

207
14:19.700 --> 14:21.000
And the other side...

208
14:20.360 --> 14:23.170
♪ I look up at the sky ♪

209
14:23.690 --> 14:26.340
♪ And there you are, always by my side ♪

210
14:27.140 --> 14:29.550
♪ Since when did it begin? ♪

211
14:29.570 --> 14:32.770
♪ I can't quite recall ♪

212
14:30.620 --> 14:31.500
You're kind of

213
14:31.500 --> 14:33.000
interrupting my teaching.

214
14:33.000 --> 14:33.790
Fu Shize.

215
14:33.680 --> 14:36.770
♪ You became the clouds in my dreams ♪

216
14:36.750 --> 14:37.790
Is origami important?

217
14:37.270 --> 14:39.430
♪ Silent and weightless ♪

218
14:39.690 --> 14:42.730
♪ I wish I could stay ♪

219
14:43.200 --> 14:46.500
♪ Walking by your side forever ♪

220
14:48.300 --> 14:51.230
♪ Through seasons of endless change ♪

221
14:51.250 --> 14:53.410
♪ Through tides that ebb and flow ♪

222
14:55.210 --> 14:58.160
♪ Letting moments overlap ♪

223
14:58.190 --> 15:00.480
♪ As we feel the world transform ♪

224
15:01.620 --> 15:05.190
♪ I'm just glad I was brave enough ♪

225
15:05.360 --> 15:08.220
♪ To meet the moon ♪

226
15:08.240 --> 15:11.170
♪ Gently, I pluck a piece of it ♪

227
15:11.200 --> 15:14.090
♪ And let loneliness fade away ♪

228
15:14.110 --> 15:18.270
♪ I just wanna stay with you ♪

229
15:17.600 --> 15:19.120
It's been so long.

230
15:18.600 --> 15:21.470
♪ That's the only thing that matters ♪

231
15:21.500 --> 15:25.240
♪ Love gives us all ♪

232
15:25.260 --> 15:28.320
♪ Like the moon lighting up every night ♪

233
15:28.340 --> 15:29.160
♪ You know ♪

234
15:29.180 --> 15:32.420
♪ I'm in love with you ♪

235
15:32.440 --> 15:35.250
♪ No matter how many times I say I love you ♪

236
15:35.270 --> 15:38.850
♪ Clouds, please drift a little closer ♪

237
15:38.890 --> 15:42.100
By giving me this, are you trying to say...

238
15:39.750 --> 15:44.650
♪ I could say it ten thousand times and never tire ♪

239
15:43.890 --> 15:45.720
you still miss me?

240
16:28.790 --> 16:29.650
Change the bed sheets

241
16:29.650 --> 16:30.790
for the guest in room 209.

242
16:30.790 --> 16:31.370
Okay.

243
16:46.220 --> 16:46.860
Did you come here

244
16:46.860 --> 16:48.320
to interfere with my work?

245
16:50.870 --> 16:51.660
No.

246
16:52.720 --> 16:54.390
I just missed you too much.

247
16:55.290 --> 16:57.410
Stop running over here every few days.

248
16:57.410 --> 16:58.810
Are flight tickets free?

249
16:59.200 --> 17:00.330
Money is no big deal.

250
17:00.770 --> 17:01.290
Think about it.

251
17:01.290 --> 17:02.000
You're so pretty

252
17:02.000 --> 17:02.930
and so charming.

253
17:02.980 --> 17:03.600
What if someone

254
17:03.600 --> 17:05.160
with similar good taste to mine

255
17:05.160 --> 17:06.160
steals you away?

256
17:06.190 --> 17:07.609
Then I'd be doomed.

257
17:08.920 --> 17:10.520
You're such a smooth talker.

258
17:10.589 --> 17:11.310
Hurry up

259
17:11.310 --> 17:12.510
and review your lessons.

260
17:12.510 --> 17:14.660
Are you not gonna take the postgraduate exam?

261
17:14.660 --> 17:16.030
If you keep muddling along like this

262
17:16.030 --> 17:17.030
and fail the exam,

263
17:17.089 --> 17:18.750
my dad will think you are not good enough for me,

264
17:18.750 --> 17:20.210
and we'll have to break up.

265
17:20.640 --> 17:21.310
Don't.

266
17:21.510 --> 17:22.710
Keep your voice down.

267
17:23.290 --> 17:24.750
I'll start reviewing tomorrow.

268
17:24.750 --> 17:25.849
Tomorrow?

269
17:26.200 --> 17:28.400
You should go back and study right away.

270
17:28.660 --> 17:29.350
But look,

271
17:29.350 --> 17:30.000
it's almost

272
17:30.000 --> 17:31.220
lunch time.

273
17:31.220 --> 17:32.150
You need to take a lunch break.

274
17:32.150 --> 17:33.720
Let's go have lunch together.

275
17:33.720 --> 17:34.980
All you know is eating.

276
17:36.960 --> 17:37.810
I'm begging you.

277
17:37.810 --> 17:38.810
I rushed over here

278
17:38.810 --> 17:39.510
early this morning.

279
17:39.510 --> 17:40.510
I haven't had a single bite

280
17:40.510 --> 17:41.440
to eat until now.

281
17:41.500 --> 17:42.290
Please.

282
17:44.590 --> 17:45.460
Fine.

283
17:45.700 --> 17:47.100
Hurry back after eating.

284
17:48.400 --> 17:49.530
So I'll book a table?

285
17:54.510 --> 17:55.170
You've

286
17:55.190 --> 17:56.950
lost weight from working so much lately.

287
17:56.950 --> 17:58.710
You need more protein.

288
17:59.510 --> 18:00.440
This is good too.

289
18:00.810 --> 18:01.610
Try this.

290
18:05.610 --> 18:06.540
This is good too.

291
18:08.900 --> 18:09.700
Lili!

292
18:12.180 --> 18:13.530
So you invited Lili?

293
18:13.900 --> 18:15.200
I haven't seen Lili for a long time either.

294
18:15.200 --> 18:16.510
If you have a problem with it, you can leave.

295
18:16.510 --> 18:17.770
I don't have a problem.

296
18:17.960 --> 18:18.790
It's just that it's rare for us

297
18:18.790 --> 18:19.790
to have a chance to be alone, and...

298
18:19.790 --> 18:21.250
Don't talk too much later.

299
18:21.590 --> 18:22.400
Lili.

300
18:23.960 --> 18:24.750
Lili.

301
18:24.800 --> 18:25.550
Fu Zhengchu,

302
18:25.580 --> 18:27.110
are you here to clock in again today?

303
18:27.110 --> 18:28.920
I call this maintaining our relationship.

304
18:28.920 --> 18:30.400
Otherwise, I'm afraid someone

305
18:30.400 --> 18:31.800
will steal my Tangy away.

306
18:32.090 --> 18:33.460
Just eat.

307
18:35.220 --> 18:36.610
I didn't dare to call you.

308
18:36.610 --> 18:38.090
I was afraid you were too busy.

309
18:38.090 --> 18:38.920
Whenever you want to see me,

310
18:38.920 --> 18:39.850
I'm always free.

311
18:40.960 --> 18:41.760
What about me?

312
18:42.790 --> 18:43.720
Why do you have to get involved in everything?

313
18:43.720 --> 18:44.290
Eat up.

314
18:44.290 --> 18:45.490
Go home after eating.

315
18:51.200 --> 18:52.500
Oh, right. Lili.

316
18:52.720 --> 18:53.590
Tangy told me

317
18:53.590 --> 18:55.090
that Yun Ye's teaching assistant

318
18:55.090 --> 18:55.960
is my uncle.

319
18:56.400 --> 18:57.310
Have you guys

320
18:57.310 --> 18:58.250
met yet?

321
19:00.960 --> 19:02.290
You're full, right? Hurry up and leave.

322
19:02.290 --> 19:03.200
But I haven't even started eating.

323
19:03.200 --> 19:03.900
Get going.

324
19:05.630 --> 19:07.090
Then... Then I'll...

325
19:07.090 --> 19:08.220
I'll get going then.

326
19:08.420 --> 19:09.220
Bye-bye.

327
19:09.250 --> 19:10.050
Bye-bye.

328
19:12.750 --> 19:14.350
Why did you chase him away?

329
19:14.350 --> 19:15.680
He has a flight to catch.

330
19:15.700 --> 19:16.560
Catch a flight?

331
19:31.290 --> 19:32.090
Tangy,

332
19:32.550 --> 19:33.350
um...

333
19:34.110 --> 19:35.000
A few days ago,

334
19:36.400 --> 19:37.460
Fu Shize

335
19:38.790 --> 19:41.200
gave me a paper lantern.

336
19:41.710 --> 19:42.590
A paper lantern?

337
19:42.590 --> 19:43.400
What's that?

338
19:45.290 --> 19:47.290
I taught him how to fold them before.

339
19:47.750 --> 19:49.750
He said whenever he thinks of the past,

340
19:49.750 --> 19:51.280
he can't stop folding them.

341
19:51.550 --> 19:52.700
What does he want?

342
19:52.720 --> 19:55.050
Does he want to get back together with you?

343
19:55.540 --> 19:56.630
I don't know.

344
19:57.050 --> 19:57.810
You know how much

345
19:57.810 --> 19:59.010
he put you through,

346
19:59.010 --> 19:59.960
right?

347
20:03.160 --> 20:03.960
I know.

348
20:04.290 --> 20:05.750
You'd better really know.

349
20:25.940 --> 20:26.610
Yun Ye.

350
20:28.310 --> 20:29.000
Are you...

351
20:30.850 --> 20:31.780
feeling better?

352
20:33.160 --> 20:34.310
I'm fine.

353
20:43.090 --> 20:43.900
Yun Ye.

354
20:48.160 --> 20:48.960
Never mind.

355
20:55.010 --> 20:55.790
Do you think your sister and I

356
20:55.790 --> 20:56.920
still have a chance?

357
21:00.510 --> 21:02.270
Yun Ye, come in and change your dressing.

358
21:02.270 --> 21:02.800
Okay.

359
21:03.430 --> 21:04.250
I'm going in.

360
21:16.590 --> 21:17.720
Is Yun Ye okay?

361
21:18.750 --> 21:19.550
He's fine.

362
21:19.900 --> 21:20.900
He just got bitten by a bug

363
21:20.900 --> 21:22.830
and went to put some medicine on it.

364
21:23.220 --> 21:24.680
Okay, I'll go check on him.

365
21:30.240 --> 21:30.960
Yun Ye.

366
21:31.460 --> 21:32.090
Li.

367
21:32.110 --> 21:32.920
Let me see.

368
21:33.750 --> 21:34.550
It's nothing.

369
21:36.010 --> 21:36.790
You're a grown man.

370
21:36.790 --> 21:37.790
How did you get bitten by a bug?

371
21:37.790 --> 21:39.790
Can't you give us some peace of mind?

372
21:40.010 --> 21:41.290
I'm already like this.

373
21:41.290 --> 21:43.140
Stop nagging me.

374
21:44.200 --> 21:45.420
Mom and Dad called me

375
21:45.420 --> 21:47.020
and asked me to take you back.

376
21:47.020 --> 21:47.900
They heard you got bitten

377
21:47.900 --> 21:48.890
by some unknown bug

378
21:48.890 --> 21:49.560
and were so worried.

379
21:49.560 --> 21:51.530
They have to see you with their own eyes to put their minds at ease.

380
21:51.530 --> 21:53.460
Li, can you talk to Mom and Dad?

381
21:53.460 --> 21:55.110
Ever since the surgery,

382
21:55.110 --> 21:56.310
they've been a bit...

383
21:58.810 --> 22:00.400
a bit too overprotective.

384
22:00.500 --> 22:01.400
The hospital issued a notice

385
22:01.400 --> 22:03.310
saying you were in critical condition.

386
22:03.310 --> 22:04.110
In their eyes,

387
22:04.110 --> 22:05.000
you have a bad track record.

388
22:05.000 --> 22:06.730
I can't talk to them about this.

389
22:07.290 --> 22:08.090
Fine.

390
22:14.310 --> 22:16.590
Reporting the situation to Yunyi?

391
22:20.000 --> 22:21.260
None of your business.

392
22:22.220 --> 22:23.160
Looks like she didn't

393
22:23.160 --> 22:24.810
come to the hospital with you.

394
22:24.810 --> 22:26.250
I didn't tell her.

395
22:27.590 --> 22:28.220
To be honest,

396
22:28.220 --> 22:29.880
it doesn't look that serious.

397
22:30.000 --> 22:32.060
It's one thing you didn't tell Yunyi,

398
22:32.270 --> 22:33.270
but why did you...

399
22:36.620 --> 22:38.580
He insisted on bringing me here.

400
22:39.180 --> 22:40.290
Maybe...

401
22:41.200 --> 22:42.330
he wanted to see you?

402
22:42.590 --> 22:44.320
Could you please wait outside?

403
22:57.750 --> 22:59.010
Thank you for bringing

404
22:59.090 --> 23:00.690
Yun Ye to the hospital today.

405
23:01.720 --> 23:03.450
I had nothing else to do anyway.

406
23:03.510 --> 23:05.440
Don't you need to go back to school?

407
23:06.050 --> 23:06.850
No.

408
23:10.510 --> 23:11.720
I'll keep you company while you're

409
23:11.720 --> 23:12.650
waiting for him.

410
23:21.050 --> 23:21.850
Have a seat.

411
23:22.920 --> 23:23.440
Okay.

412
24:21.550 --> 24:22.350
Um...

413
24:22.490 --> 24:23.860
Is... your

414
24:24.720 --> 24:26.660
stomach... feeling better now?

415
24:27.880 --> 24:28.460
Yeah.

416
24:33.310 --> 24:34.220
I had surgery.

417
24:37.590 --> 24:38.590
What surgery?

418
24:39.400 --> 24:40.570
Surgery for a perforated stomach.

419
24:40.570 --> 24:42.280
What? That serious?

420
24:43.000 --> 24:44.660
When did you have the surgery?

421
24:48.090 --> 24:48.900
Last year.

422
24:50.790 --> 24:51.590
Last year?

423
24:54.930 --> 24:55.950
I don't remember

424
24:56.400 --> 24:57.500
the exact time.

425
24:59.200 --> 25:00.190
Was it March?

426
25:03.000 --> 25:03.790
No.

427
25:04.080 --> 25:06.160
The second half of last year, I think.

428
25:10.660 --> 25:12.160
You have stomach problems.

429
25:12.160 --> 25:13.460
You need to eat regularly.

430
25:13.460 --> 25:14.350
Don't eat anything too hot

431
25:14.350 --> 25:15.790
or too cold.

432
25:17.000 --> 25:18.640
And stop drinking coffee.

433
25:20.310 --> 25:20.900
Okay.

434
25:21.530 --> 25:24.010
And you definitely shouldn't drink alcohol.

435
25:24.010 --> 25:25.740
I quit drinking a long time ago.

436
25:26.700 --> 25:27.420
Also...

437
25:27.420 --> 25:28.090
Li.

438
25:29.330 --> 25:30.000
I'm done.

439
25:33.000 --> 25:34.530
The wound has been treated?

440
25:35.290 --> 25:36.090
Alright.

441
25:36.500 --> 25:37.550
Thank you.

442
25:37.720 --> 25:39.780
I'll treat you to a meal when I'm free.

443
25:41.400 --> 25:42.200
Sure.

444
25:43.960 --> 25:45.160
When will you be free?

445
25:49.660 --> 25:53.010
I'll... let you know later.

446
25:56.960 --> 25:57.750
Yun Ye.

447
25:58.310 --> 25:59.870
Get some rest when you go back.

448
25:59.870 --> 26:01.550
If there's anything you don't understand in class,

449
26:01.550 --> 26:02.590
you can talk to me anytime.

450
26:02.590 --> 26:03.250
Okay.

451
26:05.350 --> 26:06.200
Say thank you.

452
26:06.960 --> 26:08.270
Thank you.

453
26:08.310 --> 26:09.250
Thank you, sir.

454
26:09.680 --> 26:10.200
Take care.

455
26:10.200 --> 26:10.850
Okay.

456
26:39.810 --> 26:40.610
Li.

457
26:42.070 --> 26:43.200
I have a gift for you.

458
26:43.480 --> 26:44.220
What is it?

459
26:44.900 --> 26:45.940
I managed to get a ticket

460
26:45.940 --> 26:47.480
for N27 Band's concert.

461
26:47.480 --> 26:49.180
They're only playing one show in Xifu.

462
26:49.180 --> 26:51.090
It sold out instantly when tickets went on sale this weekend.

463
26:51.090 --> 26:51.810
It's yours.

464
26:52.090 --> 26:54.050
You only got one ticket,

465
26:54.050 --> 26:55.610
so you couldn't go

466
26:55.610 --> 26:56.160
with your YY,

467
26:56.160 --> 26:56.750
and you didn't want

468
26:56.750 --> 26:57.510
to go alone,

469
26:57.510 --> 26:58.750
so you're giving it to me, right?

470
26:58.750 --> 26:59.720
Come on. Why do you

471
26:59.720 --> 27:00.660
overthink everything?

472
27:00.660 --> 27:02.350
I just want to be nice to you.

473
27:02.350 --> 27:03.290
Is that wrong?

474
27:03.850 --> 27:04.660
No.

475
27:05.330 --> 27:06.130
Do you want it?

476
27:06.960 --> 27:07.680
Totally.

477
27:07.920 --> 27:08.720
Thanks.

478
27:09.500 --> 27:10.310
Give me 200.

479
27:11.250 --> 27:12.350
I knew you were...

480
27:31.520 --> 27:32.720
You want to go with me?

481
27:33.200 --> 27:33.810
No.

482
27:34.400 --> 27:35.750
Yun Ye got a ticket.

483
27:36.010 --> 27:38.340
I want to give it to you as a thank-you gift.

484
27:40.810 --> 27:42.380
No need. Thanks.

485
27:45.810 --> 27:48.140
It seems this ticket wasn't that hard to get.

486
27:48.140 --> 27:49.600
Yun Ye was bragging again.

487
27:55.570 --> 27:56.830
What should I give him?

488
28:05.050 --> 28:05.850
You're here.

489
28:06.400 --> 28:08.200
It's really hard to see you.

490
28:10.050 --> 28:11.450
How have you been lately?

491
28:13.660 --> 28:14.350
It seems like you say

492
28:14.350 --> 28:15.810
the same thing every time.

493
28:15.810 --> 28:16.510
It's like you're an AI

494
28:16.510 --> 28:17.840
programmed to say that.

495
28:18.610 --> 28:20.050
I just care about you.

496
28:21.000 --> 28:22.400
Is your insomnia better?

497
28:23.660 --> 28:24.860
I'm taking medicine.

498
28:25.960 --> 28:27.000
I've been in Xifu

499
28:27.000 --> 28:27.960
for so many days,

500
28:28.460 --> 28:30.290
but I haven't been able to meet up with you.

501
28:30.290 --> 28:31.110
What made you want

502
28:31.110 --> 28:32.440
to meet up with me today?

503
28:39.550 --> 28:40.350
Tonight?

504
28:42.790 --> 28:43.850
Who did you ask out?

505
28:43.850 --> 28:44.610
You.

506
28:45.660 --> 28:47.030
How come I didn't know?

507
28:51.310 --> 28:52.850
Yun Li should be going too.

508
28:54.290 --> 28:55.090
Yun Li?

509
28:56.250 --> 28:58.180
She also has a ticket for this show.

510
29:01.160 --> 29:01.960
I see.

511
29:02.810 --> 29:03.850
You want me to go with you

512
29:03.850 --> 29:05.160
to be your wingman.

513
29:06.400 --> 29:07.550
I'm best at this.

514
29:08.590 --> 29:10.250
We're just watching the show.

515
29:10.250 --> 29:12.110
I'm not asking you to do anything.

516
29:14.750 --> 29:16.090
Just watching the show?

517
29:19.010 --> 29:20.160
Since when did you

518
29:20.160 --> 29:21.590
like rock and roll?

519
29:26.220 --> 29:27.960
I wonder who said before

520
29:28.500 --> 29:29.790
that he would finish his studies

521
29:29.790 --> 29:31.120
before looking for her.

522
29:32.850 --> 29:33.790
We just

523
29:34.350 --> 29:36.500
happened to run into each other.

524
29:40.510 --> 29:42.440
What was her attitude towards you?

525
29:43.940 --> 29:44.960
She...

526
29:51.400 --> 29:52.200
Let's go.

527
29:52.790 --> 29:53.790
It's almost time.

528
29:55.250 --> 29:56.050
Come on.

529
29:56.400 --> 29:57.250
What time is it?

530
29:57.250 --> 29:58.420
It's too early to go.

531
29:58.420 --> 29:59.820
It's not early. Let's go.

532
30:17.290 --> 30:17.810
Thanks.

533
30:23.960 --> 30:24.960
We came so early

534
30:24.960 --> 30:26.440
just to wait for her here?

535
30:29.350 --> 30:31.610
Why didn't you just ask her out directly?

536
30:32.290 --> 30:34.020
If I had asked her out directly,

537
30:35.050 --> 30:36.580
I might have been rejected.

538
30:36.920 --> 30:38.450
Aren't you going to tell me?

539
30:39.220 --> 30:40.310
Tell you what?

540
30:40.700 --> 30:41.350
Does she know

541
30:41.350 --> 30:43.480
you want to get back together with her?

542
30:45.460 --> 30:47.260
She...

543
30:48.510 --> 30:49.840
probably doesn't know.

544
30:59.910 --> 31:03.840
[The Magic of Light and Shadow: A Vintage Camera Review]

545
31:20.510 --> 31:21.310
The author clearly lays out

546
31:21.310 --> 31:22.500
the evolution and development

547
31:22.500 --> 31:23.660
of the technology

548
31:24.680 --> 31:26.940
and offers some unique insights as well.

549
31:32.010 --> 31:33.400
We didn't wait in vain.

550
31:33.790 --> 31:34.850
The target is here.

551
31:41.660 --> 31:42.350
Yun Li?

552
31:43.550 --> 31:44.660
Long time no see.

553
31:49.400 --> 31:50.890
Long time no see, Mr. Xu.

554
31:53.790 --> 31:54.850
Did you come alone?

555
31:56.180 --> 31:56.940
Mm-hmm.

556
32:01.220 --> 32:03.070
Come on. Let's go in together.

557
32:04.810 --> 32:05.570
Okay.

558
32:16.620 --> 32:18.820
♪ Let the music lead us ♪

559
32:19.040 --> 32:21.580
♪ To where we want to go ♪

560
32:21.600 --> 32:24.080
♪ Let the sound waves guide us ♪

561
32:24.180 --> 32:26.830
♪ In this glowing show ♪

562
32:26.930 --> 32:29.330
♪ In this crowded hall ♪

563
32:29.350 --> 32:31.580
♪ Looking for the light ♪

564
32:31.600 --> 32:34.080
♪ You are my safe ♪

565
32:34.100 --> 32:36.580
♪ Harbor tonight ♪

566
32:46.640 --> 32:48.480
♪ Under the urban light ♪

567
32:48.500 --> 32:49.850
♪ The silent energy ♪

568
32:49.870 --> 32:51.230
♪ Holding on too tight ♪

569
32:51.260 --> 32:52.420
♪ The crowd intertwines ♪

570
32:52.440 --> 32:53.510
♪ Just follow the waves blindly ♪

571
32:53.540 --> 32:54.660
♪ And we're standstill ♪

572
32:54.690 --> 32:56.010
♪ With nowhere to go ♪

573
32:56.030 --> 32:57.020
♪ A sharp-looking suit ♪

574
32:57.050 --> 33:00.700
♪ In this tense space ♪

575
32:57.790 --> 32:59.120
It's too stuffy in here.

576
32:59.200 --> 33:00.330
I'm going out first.

577
33:00.760 --> 33:03.250
♪ Looking for our rhythm ♪

578
33:03.340 --> 33:05.340
♪ In this new moment ♪

579
33:05.710 --> 33:07.990
♪ Let the music lead us ♪

580
33:08.700 --> 33:10.990
♪ To where we want to go ♪

581
33:11.070 --> 33:13.340
♪ Let the sound waves guide us ♪

582
33:13.520 --> 33:16.240
♪ In this glowing show ♪

583
33:16.270 --> 33:18.590
♪ In this crowded hall ♪

584
33:18.620 --> 33:21.480
♪ Looking for the light ♪

585
33:20.250 --> 33:22.010
Will you go back to EAW?

586
33:21.500 --> 33:23.500
♪ You are my safe ♪

587
33:24.110 --> 33:25.840
♪ Harbor tonight ♪

588
33:25.660 --> 33:27.420
Will you go back to EAW?

589
33:29.520 --> 33:33.150
♪ Harbor tonight ♪

590
33:31.700 --> 33:32.760
I'm not going back.

591
33:33.530 --> 33:34.330
What's wrong?

592
33:39.450 --> 33:41.160
Seeing Mr. Xu

593
33:41.900 --> 33:43.420
reminded me that I haven't played

594
33:43.420 --> 33:44.680
VR games in a long time.

595
33:52.900 --> 33:53.920
Do you want to go?

596
34:00.960 --> 34:01.720
Yeah.

597
34:06.090 --> 34:08.760
Then... I'll go with you.

598
34:36.050 --> 34:38.150
Did... Did I bump into you?

599
34:40.090 --> 34:40.900
No.

600
34:41.800 --> 34:43.050
I just couldn't hear clearly,

601
34:43.050 --> 34:44.510
so I got a little closer.

602
34:47.500 --> 34:49.360
I just wanted you to hear clearly.

603
34:59.300 --> 35:01.390
I... I need to use the restroom.

604
35:15.860 --> 35:16.650
What's wrong?

605
35:16.650 --> 35:17.110
Seriously,

606
35:17.110 --> 35:19.230
that singer is so handsome.

607
36:07.210 --> 36:07.920
Mr. Xu.

608
36:08.320 --> 36:09.110
Yun Li?

609
36:09.860 --> 36:10.990
Why did you come out?

610
36:11.870 --> 36:13.070
To get some fresh air?

611
36:13.690 --> 36:14.460
Or were you also

612
36:14.460 --> 36:15.720
deafened by the noise?

613
36:17.860 --> 36:19.010
I really don't understand.

614
36:19.010 --> 36:20.760
What's the difference between this

615
36:20.760 --> 36:22.020
and renovation noise?

616
36:28.650 --> 36:30.260
I don't know what Shize was thinking.

617
36:30.260 --> 36:31.650
He likes quiet

618
36:31.650 --> 36:33.300
and never listens to rock music,

619
36:33.300 --> 36:34.760
yet he invited me to this.

620
36:35.300 --> 36:36.700
We arrived at 4:30,

621
36:36.800 --> 36:39.000
and I haven't had a sip of water yet.

622
36:40.210 --> 36:41.610
You guys came that early?

623
36:42.860 --> 36:44.260
Shize told me to come over

624
36:44.360 --> 36:45.960
to wait for someone with him.

625
36:47.710 --> 36:49.310
Wait for someone? Well...

626
36:49.330 --> 36:50.530
Did that person come?

627
36:56.320 --> 36:57.110
Yun Li.

628
36:57.820 --> 36:58.510
Do you remember

629
36:58.510 --> 36:59.760
I told you before

630
37:00.090 --> 37:00.800
that Shize is

631
37:00.800 --> 37:02.330
a very sentimental person?

632
37:03.510 --> 37:05.310
Once he sets his mind on someone,

633
37:05.940 --> 37:07.500
he won't change easily.

634
37:14.590 --> 37:15.920
Something just came up.

635
37:15.920 --> 37:17.610
I'll treat you to a late-night snack another day.

636
37:17.610 --> 37:18.670
I'll get going now.

637
37:18.850 --> 37:19.780
Bye, Mr. Xu.

638
37:26.690 --> 37:29.190
How did you get here today?

639
37:29.500 --> 37:30.510
I took a taxi.

640
37:30.920 --> 37:32.150
Then I'll drive you.

641
37:32.650 --> 37:33.460
No need.

642
37:33.590 --> 37:35.010
I can just take a taxi.

643
37:36.010 --> 37:37.780
Okay, then I'll wait with you.

644
37:42.360 --> 37:44.590
Efe's always first in the comments.

645
37:44.780 --> 37:47.010
Is that even humanly possible?

646
37:47.070 --> 37:47.690
Next time, can you

647
37:47.690 --> 37:48.800
pretend your internet is lagging

648
37:48.800 --> 37:49.820
and give us a chance?

649
37:49.820 --> 37:50.620
What's wrong?

650
37:51.300 --> 37:53.100
I have a follower on EAW

651
37:53.320 --> 37:54.760
who's really interesting.

652
37:54.760 --> 37:55.760
Every time I post a video,

653
37:55.760 --> 37:57.620
he's always the first to comment.

654
37:57.760 --> 37:58.610
Then other followers

655
37:58.610 --> 37:59.460
complain to him, saying,

656
37:59.460 --> 38:01.920
"How do you always manage to comment first?"

657
38:04.690 --> 38:06.260
Actually, he's quite nice.

658
38:06.860 --> 38:07.860
He watches every video

659
38:07.860 --> 38:08.710
I post,

660
38:09.090 --> 38:10.860
and he watches them attentively

661
38:10.860 --> 38:12.320
and even gives me

662
38:12.320 --> 38:14.050
some meaningful suggestions.

663
38:15.270 --> 38:17.530
Sometimes when things are difficult...

664
38:17.650 --> 38:18.460
When I was in a foreign country,

665
38:18.460 --> 38:19.690
reading his DMs

666
38:19.690 --> 38:22.400
made me... feel better.

667
38:33.000 --> 38:34.150
It's quite nice

668
38:35.650 --> 38:37.250
to have a follower like that.

669
38:40.500 --> 38:41.210
Thank you.

670
39:00.090 --> 39:01.360
Is that you?

671
39:08.950 --> 39:10.080
Is that you?

672
39:15.650 --> 39:18.190
Did you get a taxi?

673
39:19.800 --> 39:21.200
I haven't called one yet.

674
39:22.710 --> 39:23.710
Then do you want to

675
39:25.010 --> 39:26.870
find somewhere to sit for a while?

676
39:35.940 --> 39:36.610
So,

677
39:37.050 --> 39:39.050
you've been following me all along.

678
39:43.710 --> 39:44.320
Yeah.

679
39:48.320 --> 39:49.450
I just wanted to know

680
39:50.000 --> 39:51.260
if you were doing well.

681
39:52.690 --> 39:54.950
But I was afraid of disturbing your life.

682
39:58.110 --> 39:58.590
Does it make you

683
39:58.590 --> 40:00.250
uncomfortable when I do this?

684
40:04.550 --> 40:05.420
It's okay.

685
40:10.950 --> 40:12.820
But I still hope you can be honest.

686
40:13.650 --> 40:14.260
Okay.

687
40:16.960 --> 40:17.760
Okay.

688
40:20.960 --> 40:22.750
So, when I was in the UK,

689
40:24.090 --> 40:27.050
the fan postcards I received

690
40:29.190 --> 40:30.520
were sent by you, right?

691
40:33.110 --> 40:33.710
Yeah.

692
40:39.010 --> 40:39.820
Actually...

693
40:43.010 --> 40:44.470
Actually, I went to the UK.

694
40:46.380 --> 40:47.480
When?

695
40:48.140 --> 40:49.270
Whenever I had time,

696
40:51.320 --> 40:52.110
I'd go there.

697
40:54.760 --> 40:56.150
So, one rainy day,

698
40:57.550 --> 40:59.080
I didn't bring an umbrella.

699
40:59.550 --> 41:01.000
I went to a bookstore,

700
41:02.090 --> 41:02.900
and someone kind

701
41:02.900 --> 41:04.500
left an umbrella for me.

702
41:05.510 --> 41:06.500
Was that you too?

703
41:09.480 --> 41:10.070
Yeah.

704
41:18.150 --> 41:18.920
Well...

705
41:19.320 --> 41:21.400
is it too late to say thank you now?

706
41:23.820 --> 41:25.420
You already said it just now.

707
41:27.760 --> 41:28.550
Actually,

708
41:28.960 --> 41:31.150
I always hoped it was you.

709
41:42.510 --> 41:43.320
I want

710
41:44.460 --> 41:46.060
to take you somewhere later.

711
41:48.360 --> 41:49.150
Is that okay?

712
41:58.360 --> 41:59.290
Is it beautiful?

713
42:00.550 --> 42:01.590
This is the best place

714
42:01.590 --> 42:02.790
to see the night view.

715
42:03.480 --> 42:04.070
Yeah.

716
42:10.500 --> 42:12.610
So, you come here often?

717
42:14.710 --> 42:15.320
Yeah.

718
42:16.460 --> 42:17.570
When I'm alone,

719
42:18.500 --> 42:19.900
I quite like coming here.

720
42:26.690 --> 42:27.620
In Nanwu...

721
42:29.260 --> 42:30.760
while you were away,

722
42:31.400 --> 42:32.110
I also often went to

723
42:32.110 --> 42:33.510
the rooftop to space out.

724
42:35.500 --> 42:36.320
Why?

725
42:37.710 --> 42:38.910
Because I missed you.

726
42:46.580 --> 42:48.220
♪ I grew used to ♪

727
42:48.240 --> 42:51.650
♪ Keeping a polite distance ♪

728
42:49.610 --> 42:50.420
So,

729
42:51.090 --> 42:52.150
today,

730
42:53.150 --> 42:54.900
were you waiting for me on purpose?

731
42:53.630 --> 42:55.840
♪ Until you came along ♪

732
42:56.030 --> 42:59.610
♪ And messed up all my logic ♪

733
43:00.340 --> 43:00.940
Yeah.

734
43:01.420 --> 43:03.600
♪ I once thought it through carefully ♪

735
43:03.640 --> 43:07.880
♪ The breath drawn as I lean in on purpose ♪

736
43:08.960 --> 43:10.710
♪ When I stand right beside you ♪

737
43:09.900 --> 43:10.610
Lili.

738
43:10.730 --> 43:15.310
♪ Even silence starts to mean something ♪

739
43:13.760 --> 43:17.500
Can we... get back together?

740
43:16.910 --> 43:19.860
♪ I know those fears ♪

741
43:19.890 --> 43:23.230
♪ May never truly fade away ♪

742
43:21.260 --> 43:22.920
Then let me ask you something.

743
43:23.400 --> 43:24.610
When Yun Ye was sick,

744
43:26.010 --> 43:26.800
why didn't you

745
43:26.800 --> 43:28.460
reply to my messages for days?

746
43:30.900 --> 43:33.510
I didn't tell the truth last time.

747
43:35.860 --> 43:36.650
That day,

748
43:38.080 --> 43:40.680
I'd just had surgery for a perforated stomach.

749
43:41.180 --> 43:42.760
Before that, I'd been running a fever,

750
43:42.760 --> 43:44.360
and I woke up in the hospital.

751
43:45.510 --> 43:46.910
I was afraid you'd worry,

752
43:47.320 --> 43:48.650
so I didn't let you know.

753
43:49.930 --> 43:50.810
I planned to go to Xifu

754
43:50.810 --> 43:52.320
to find you after I was discharged.

755
43:52.320 --> 43:53.820
So when I broke up with you,

756
43:53.820 --> 43:55.420
why didn't you say anything?

757
44:14.660 --> 44:15.930
Did you see

758
44:16.010 --> 44:18.260
the thing I left for you?

759
44:21.650 --> 44:23.320
You threw away the brochure?

760
44:24.760 --> 44:25.550
Yes.
